''' Skana Incarnon Genesis''' is an item that is used to add [[Incarnon]] upgrades to the {{Weapon|Skana}}, {{Weapon|Prisma Skana}} or {{Weapon|Skana Prime}}.
==Acquisition==
*Upon completion of [[The Duviri Paradox]] and [[Angels of the Zariman]], and unlocking [[The Steel Path]], players can earn {{Resource|1=Skana Incarnon Genesis}} from [[The Circuit]]'s Steel Path to place on their Skana with the help of [[Cavalero]] in the [[Chrysalith]]. This [[Incarnon Genesis]] form grants it evolutions to a transformation and newfound strength.
*Purchased from Cavalero for {{pc|120}}, complete with the resources used in its installation. This purchase can only be made '''once'''.

==Incarnon Genesis==

===Evolutions===
*Installing the Skana Incarnon Genesis requires '''20''' {{Resource|Pathos Clamp|Pathos Clamps}}, '''70''' {{Resource|Dracroot}}, and '''80''' {{Resource|Connla Sprout|Connla Sprouts}}.
*When installed, the first Evolution tier is unlocked. The following Evolution tiers, their requirements for unlocking them, and their related perks, are shown below; 
**Each challenge additionally grants '''5,000''' [[affinity]] to the weapon, affected by [[Affinity Booster]]s.

====Evolution I====
*Reach '''6x''' Combo and then [[Melee#Heavy Attack|Heavy Attack]] to activate Incarnon Form.
*Incarnon Form stuns nearby enemies when it enters Incarnon Form and after [[Finisher]] attacks.
**'''+100%''' Melee Damage
**'''+20%''' Sprint Speed
**'''+20%''' Bullet Jump
*Incarnon Form lasts for '''180''' seconds and persists until [[death]].

====Evolution II====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Complete a solo mission with this weapon equipped.
*Perk 1: '''Guardian's Promise:'''
**Increase Damage by '''+100''' (Skana) / '''+100''' (Prisma) / '''+10''' (Prime).
**With Overshields: '''+80%''' Heavy Attack Efficiency.
*Perk 2: '''Wartime Nerve:'''
**Increase Damage by '''+90''' (Skana) / '''+90''' (Prisma) / '''+10''' (Prime)
**'''+9''' Combo Count on undamaged enemies.
***Enemies are undamaged as long as their health and shield have not been damaged. It doesn't affect [[Whipclaw]].
****Damaging [[Overguard]] is not taken into account.

====Evolution III====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Activate this weapon's Incarnon Form '''6''' times in a mission.
*Perk 1: '''Orokin Reach:'''
**Increase Range by '''+0.4'''.
*Perk 2: '''Resolute Force:'''
**'''+6s''' Combo Duration.
*Perk 3: '''Swift Break:'''
**'''+50%''' Heavy Attack Wind Up Speed.

====Evolution IV====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Reach '''10x''' Combo Multiplier '''10''' times.
*Perk 1: '''Survivor's Edge:'''
**Increase Critical Chance by '''+12%''' (Skana) / '''+12%''' (Prisma) / '''+2%''' (Prime).
**Increase Status Chance by '''+10%''' (Skana) / '''+10%''' (Prisma) / '''+4%''' (Prime).
*Perk 2: '''Elemental Excess:'''
**Increase Status Chance by '''+20%''' (Skana) / '''+20%''' (Prisma) / '''+10%''' (Prime).
*Perk 3: '''Absolute Valor:'''
**Increase Critical Chance by '''+25%''' (Skana) / '''+25%''' (Prisma) / '''+4%''' (Prime).

==Tips==
*Using {{WF|Titania}}'s {{A|Razorwing}} deactivates the incarnon form of melee weapons, helping you unlock Evolution III quicker.

